# .graphifyignore — MxAgile Graphify Targeted Scope Definition
#
# Graphify is an OPTIONAL enrichment overlay.  This file defines which
# surfaces are indexed.  Only code-structural surfaces that yield
# actionable call-graph / import relationships belong in the graph.
#
# Why these exclusions exist (derived from the FULL_REPO vs TARGETED A/B test):
#
#   .mxagile/schemas/  — JSON Schema files decompose into keyword-only nodes
#                        (properties, enum, type, required, items, description).
#                        18 schema files produced 1,695 pure-noise nodes (29.3%
#                        of FULL_REPO), with no call or import relationships.
#                        Schema validity is enforced at canonical artifact level,
#                        not in the code graph.
#
#   .mxagile/agents/   — Plain markdown — no AST, no call edges.
#   .mxagile/skills/   — Plain markdown — no AST, no call edges.
#   .mxagile/policies/ — Plain markdown — no AST, no call edges.
#   .mxagile/adapters/ — Plain markdown — no AST, no call edges.
#   .mxagile/templates/ — Plain text/markdown templates — no call edges.
#   .mxagile/*.yaml, .mxagile/*.md, .mxagile/*.json (root config)
#                      — Config/data files, not code structural surfaces.
#
#   docs/              — Documentation markdown.  Content lives in the native
#                        Artifact Graph as CANONICAL nodes.  Graphify's markdown
#                        community-fragmentation produces pure noise here.
#
#   products/          — Product-management markdown/config, not code.
#   skillssource/      — Markdown skill sources.  Platform projection, not code.
#   planning/          — Canonical YAML lifecycle artifacts.  Already authoritative
#                        in the native Artifact Graph.  Graphify YAML parsing adds
#                        structural keyword nodes with no call relationships.
#   input-resources/   — Raw input/reference material, not executable code.
#   project-templates/ — Placeholder .gitignore stubs.  No code content.
#   sprints/           — Sprint notes/markdown, not code.
#
#   Root .md files     — README, AGENT, etc. — markdown, no AST value.
#   Root .ps1 files    — Framework bootstrap installers.  Could yield call edges
#                        but PowerShell AST support in graphify v0.9.28 produces
#                        near-zero relationships (confirmed in A/B test).  Excluded
#                        to avoid fragmented, low-signal nodes.
#
#   graphify-out*/     — Graphify output directories MUST never be self-indexed.
#                        The fail-closed retention mechanism would contaminate the
#                        graph with manifest/state nodes on incremental rebuilds.
#
#   .claude/           — Agent instructions markdown (.claude/agents/).
#                        Only .claude/skills/ is gitignored; .claude/agents/ is
#                        committed but must not be indexed as code.
#
#   .agents/           — Agent platform projections, markdown.
#
# What IS indexed (not excluded here, not in .gitignore):
#   scripts/*.py       — Python implementation modules → call graph, import graph
#   tests/*.py         — Python test files → call graph
#   tests/fixtures/    — Committed fixture code → call graph
#
# Note: .gitignore exclusions (graphify-out/, .mxagile/state/, etc.) are
# automatically respected by Graphify and do not need to be repeated here.

# ── MxAgile framework management surfaces (noise in code graph) ───────────────
.mxagile/schemas/
.mxagile/agents/
.mxagile/skills/
.mxagile/policies/
.mxagile/adapters/
.mxagile/templates/
.mxagile/migration/
.mxagile/*.yaml
.mxagile/*.md
.mxagile/*.json

# ── Documentation / narrative markdown ───────────────────────────────────────
docs/

# ── Product / project management surfaces ────────────────────────────────────
products/
skillssource/
planning/
input-resources/
project-templates/
sprints/

# ── Root-level non-code files ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.md
*.ps1

# ── Graphify output directories (must never be self-indexed) ─────────────────
graphify-out*/

# ── Agent instruction surfaces ────────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/
.agents/
